1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,345
The bugs used to attack my base.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:05,970
This time, I went into their burrow to take
on the queen!

3
00:00:07,783 --> 00:00:10,341
This is Swarm Siege, my base-defense game.

4
00:00:11,108 --> 00:00:13,903
You are watching an October fourth
development build.

5
00:00:14,658 --> 00:00:16,728
The interface is still in Chinese.

6
00:00:18,517 --> 00:00:20,037
I head out as the medic.

7
00:00:20,779 --> 00:00:24,687
Aiming and firing are automatic by default,
so positioning matters.

8
00:00:25,454 --> 00:00:27,687
Get into range and the character fires.

9
00:00:28,454 --> 00:00:30,612
Space lets me dash away in this build.

10
00:00:32,417 --> 00:00:34,912
Third person helps me watch the
surroundings.

11
00:00:35,667 --> 00:00:38,199
In this build, V switches to first person.

12
00:00:38,967 --> 00:00:42,262
Manual shooting and shortcuts can be changed
in the settings.

13
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:47,878
Before starting the wave, I clear the
abandoned supply station, collect its

14
00:00:47,887 --> 00:00:50,632
first-clear reward, and spend the coins at
the shop.

15
00:00:52,417 --> 00:00:54,524
The machine gun gives sustained fire.

16
00:00:55,292 --> 00:00:57,749
A shotgun spreads pellets at close range.

17
00:00:58,504 --> 00:01:02,344
During the beacon mission, I stay inside the
blue circle and collect coins while

18
00:01:02,354 --> 00:01:02,899
fighting.

19
00:01:04,683 --> 00:01:06,428
I can build defenses too.

20
00:01:07,183 --> 00:01:10,903
Choose a machine-gun turret, check the
placement preview, and confirm.

21
00:01:11,671 --> 00:01:14,878
A bad placement can be dismantled for half
the cost back.

22
00:01:16,650 --> 00:01:19,482
Next, I hire a teammate and enter the elite
nest.

23
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,595
The squad helps fight and collect supplies.

24
00:01:23,362 --> 00:01:25,970
Mission rewards pay for stronger equipment.

25
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:29,958
Now I can afford the pulse laser cannon.

26
00:01:30,725 --> 00:01:33,845
The next target is deep inside the map: the
alien queen.

27
00:01:35,650 --> 00:01:38,045
I follow the central burrow in first person.

28
00:01:38,812 --> 00:01:41,145
Beyond the tunnel are the queen and her
guards.

29
00:01:41,888 --> 00:01:43,570
Do not stop at the entrance.

30
00:01:44,312 --> 00:01:45,920
Move into firing range!

31
00:01:47,717 --> 00:01:50,412
The beam keeps hitting and the damage
numbers appear.

32
00:01:51,179 --> 00:01:55,032
Guards block the way, so I clear the
immediate threats before focusing on the

33
00:01:55,042 --> 00:01:55,799
queen again.

34
00:01:57,583 --> 00:01:58,616
She is down!

35
00:01:59,371 --> 00:02:03,891
In this recorded build, later swarms in the
chapter shrink by thirty-five percent.

36
00:02:04,633 --> 00:02:07,141
Attacking first takes pressure off the base.

37
00:02:08,917 --> 00:02:12,637
Back on the front line, I intercept the bugs
coming out of the burrow.

38
00:02:13,392 --> 00:02:14,637
The wave is cleared.

39
00:02:15,392 --> 00:02:18,174
Stage two begins with the base still at full
health.

40
00:02:19,950 --> 00:02:22,320
With enough coins, I can buy a vehicle.

41
00:02:23,075 --> 00:02:26,365
I board it with I in this build, then drive
through the gate for a different

42
00:02:26,375 --> 00:02:27,008
approach.

43
00:02:28,783 --> 00:02:33,328
Supplies, upgrades, defenses, and a raid on
the queen now form a complete route.

44
00:02:34,083 --> 00:02:37,791
Tunnel visibility and squad following still
needed work at this point.

45
00:02:39,583 --> 00:02:41,841
Would you defend first or raid the queen?

46
00:02:42,596 --> 00:02:45,403
The current Chinese-language demo is linked
below.

47
00:02:46,171 --> 00:02:48,078
Follow its in-game controls.

48
00:02:48,846 --> 00:02:49,978
Thanks for watching!
